{
  "candidates": [
    {
      "explanation": "Moderate pipeline-aware relaxation: reduce orders when pipeline is high relative to recent demand, increase when backlog is high and pipeline low. Node-specific thresholds.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and pipeline>2*recent and backlog==0",
          "delta": "-2"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and backlog>0 and pipeline<recent",
          "delta": "2"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==1 and pipeline>3*recent and backlog==0",
          "delta": "-3"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==1 and backlog>0 and pipeline<2*recent",
          "delta": "3"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and pipeline>4*recent and backlog==0",
          "delta": "-4"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and backlog>0 and pipeline<3*recent",
          "delta": "4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "explanation": "Aggressive backlog clearing: prioritize reducing backlog at downstream nodes by increasing orders when backlog is high, while upstream nodes reduce orders if pipeline is excessive to avoid overstock.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and backlog>0",
          "delta": "3"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and pipeline>3*recent",
          "delta": "-3"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==1 and backlog>0",
          "delta": "4"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==1 and pipeline>4*recent",
          "delta": "-4"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and backlog>0",
          "delta": "5"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and pipeline>5*recent",
          "delta": "-5"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "explanation": "Balanced approach: small adjustments based on backlog and pipeline coverage. Increase orders if backlog exists and pipeline is less than recent demand, decrease if pipeline exceeds a multiple of recent demand.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "backlog>0 and pipeline<recent",
          "delta": "2"
        },
        {
          "when": "pipeline>3*recent",
          "delta": "-2"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and backlog>0 and pipeline<2*recent",
          "delta": "3"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and pipeline>4*recent",
          "delta": "-3"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "candidates": [
    {
      "explanation": "Moderate pipeline-aware increase for nodes with backlog, small increase for node2 to avoid upstream backlog, and slight reduction for node0 if pipeline is high to prevent overordering.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and backlog>0 and pipeline<30",
          "delta": "min(4, backlog/2)"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and backlog>0 and pipeline>=30",
          "delta": "-1"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==1 and backlog>0",
          "delta": "min(3, backlog/2)"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and backlog>0",
          "delta": "min(2, backlog/2)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "explanation": "Aggressive increase for nodes with backlog and low pipeline, moderate increase for node2, and reduction for node0 if pipeline is very high to avoid overstock.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and backlog>0 and pipeline<20",
          "delta": "min(6, backlog)"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and backlog>0 and pipeline>=20",
          "delta": "-2"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==1 and backlog>0",
          "delta": "min(4, backlog)"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and backlog>0",
          "delta": "min(3, backlog)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "explanation": "Conservative increase for nodes with backlog, small increase for node2, and no change for node0 if pipeline is high to avoid overordering.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and backlog>0 and pipeline<40",
          "delta": "min(2, backlog/3)"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and backlog>0 and pipeline>=40",
          "delta": "0"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==1 and backlog>0",
          "delta": "min(2, backlog/3)"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and backlog>0",
          "delta": "min(1, backlog/3)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "candidates": [
    {
      "explanation": "Detect demand surge via growth>1.2 and raise orders at all nodes, but cap increases to avoid overshoot. Node0 increases by 2, node1 by 1, node2 by 1 when growth high. Otherwise no change.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "growth > 1.2",
          "delta": "min(2, max(0, 6 - happo))"
        },
        {
          "when": "growth > 1.2",
          "delta": "min(1, max(0, 6 - happo))"
        },
        {
          "when": "growth > 1.2",
          "delta": "min(1, max(0, 6 - happo))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "explanation": "Pipeline-aware: if growth high and pipeline low relative to recent demand, increase orders to replenish. Node0: if pipeline < recent*4, add 2. Node1: if pipeline < recent*4, add 1. Node2: if pipeline < recent*4, add 1.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "growth > 1.2 and pipeline < recent * 4",
          "delta": "min(2, max(0, 6 - happo))"
        },
        {
          "when": "growth > 1.2 and pipeline < recent * 4",
          "delta": "min(1, max(0, 6 - happo))"
        },
        {
          "when": "growth > 1.2 and pipeline < recent * 4",
          "delta": "min(1, max(0, 6 - happo))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "explanation": "Backlog-driven: if backlog > 0, increase order to clear backlog. Node0: add min(backlog, 3). Node1: add min(backlog, 2). Node2: add min(backlog, 2). Also if growth high, add 1 to all nodes.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "backlog > 0",
          "delta": "min(3, backlog)"
        },
        {
          "when": "backlog > 0",
          "delta": "min(2, backlog)"
        },
        {
          "when": "backlog > 0",
          "delta": "min(2, backlog)"
        },
        {
          "when": "growth > 1.2",
          "delta": "1"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "candidates": [
    {
      "explanation": "Node0: if backlog positive and inventory zero, increase order by 2 to recover service, but cap at 20. Node1: if backlog high and pipeline low, increase order by 3 to replenish, but avoid overordering if pipeline already high. Node2: if backlog positive and pipeline low, increase order by 2 to support upstream, but avoid overordering if pipeline high.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and backlog>0 and inventory==0",
          "delta": "min(2, 20-happo)"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==1 and backlog>10 and pipeline<40",
          "delta": "min(3, 20-happo)"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and backlog>0 and pipeline<50",
          "delta": "min(2, 20-happo)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "explanation": "Node0: if backlog positive and pipeline low, increase order by 3 to recover service. Node1: if backlog high and pipeline low, increase order by 4 to replenish. Node2: if backlog positive and pipeline low, increase order by 3 to support upstream. All corrections are capped to avoid exceeding 20.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and backlog>0 and pipeline<20",
          "delta": "min(3, 20-happo)"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==1 and backlog>10 and pipeline<40",
          "delta": "min(4, 20-happo)"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and backlog>0 and pipeline<50",
          "delta": "min(3, 20-happo)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "explanation": "Node0: if backlog positive and inventory zero, increase order by 2. Node1: if backlog high and pipeline low, increase order by 3. Node2: if backlog positive and pipeline low, increase order by 2. Additionally, if growth>1.2, add 1 to all nodes to respond to demand surge, but cap at 20.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and backlog>0 and inventory==0",
          "delta": "min(2, 20-happo)"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==1 and backlog>10 and pipeline<40",
          "delta": "min(3, 20-happo)"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and backlog>0 and pipeline<50",
          "delta": "min(2, 20-happo)"
        },
        {
          "when": "growth>1.2",
          "delta": "min(1, 20-happo)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "candidates": [
    {
      "explanation": "Refinement of llm_r1_0. Node0 has pipeline 80 and arrival 20, so its near-term supply is adequate; extra orders would only inflate upstream backlog. Node1 and node2 have arrival 20 and 18, but backlogs are large; they need modest pipeline-aware boosts to rebuild coverage without over-ordering. Rules are ordered first-match per node: first relax node0 when its pipeline already covers recent demand, then boost downstream nodes when backlog exists and pipeline is thin relative to recent demand, then trim any node whose pipeline is excessive.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and pipeline>=2*recent",
          "delta": "-2"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==1 and backlog>0 and pipeline<3*recent",
          "delta": "2"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and backlog>0 and pipeline<4*recent",
          "delta": "2"
        },
        {
          "when": "pipeline>5*recent",
          "delta": "-2"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "candidates": [
    {
      "explanation": "Node0 has high backlog and pipeline, so reduce order to avoid overburdening upstream. Node1 has no backlog but pipeline is high; reduce order to prevent upstream backlog. Node2 has no backlog and high inventory; reduce order to avoid excess inventory. This coordinated reduction should lower total cost and downstream backlog by preventing overordering.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "when": "agent==0 and backlog>0 and pipeline>=40",
          "delta": "-2"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==1 and backlog==0 and pipeline>=40",
          "delta": "-1"
        },
        {
          "when": "agent==2 and backlog==0 and inventory>20",
          "delta": "-1"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "candidates": [
